<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>창업가정신 히어로</title>
    
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },
                    colors: {
                        hero: {
                            purple: '#4C1D95', lightPurple: '#8B5CF6', 
                            yellow: '#F59E0B', darkYellow: '#D97706',
                            bg: '#F8FAFC',
                            optionA: '#1E3A8A', optionB: '#EA580C', 
                            optionC: '#F59E0B', optionD: '#4C1D95'  
                        }
                    },
                    animation: {
                        'fade-in': 'fadeIn 0.5s ease-out forwards',
                        'slide-up': 'slideUp 0.4s ease-out forwards',
                        'bounce-slight': 'bounceSlight 2s infinite ease-in-out',
                    },
                    keyframes: {
                        fadeIn: { '0%': { opacity: '0' }, '100%': { opacity: '1' } },
                        slideUp: { '0%': { opacity: '0', transform: 'translateY(20px)' }, '100%': { opacity: '1', transform: 'translateY(0)' } },
                        bounceSlight: { '0%, 100%': { transform: 'translateY(0)' }, '50%': { transform: 'translateY(-5px)' } }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; 
            background-color: #E2E8F0; 
            color: #1E293B; 
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .kiosk-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            max-width: 768px; 
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }
        
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            body { padding: 2rem 0; }
            .kiosk-container {
                height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
                border-radius: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        .step-container { display: none; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease-in-out; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 10rem; }
        .step-container.active { display: flex; flex-direction: column; opacity: 1; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out forwards; }
        
        .option-card { transition: all 0.2s ease; cursor: pointer; }
        .option-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
        
        .test-option { border: 4px solid transparent; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .test-option.selected { border-color: #8B5CF6; box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); }
        .test-option-A { background-color: #EFF6FF; }
        .test-option-B { background-color: #FFF7ED; }
        .test-option-C { background-color: #FEF3C7; }
        .test-option-D { background-color: #FAF5FF; }

        .location-radio input:checked + div { background-color: #8B5CF6; border-color: #8B5CF6; color: white; }
        
        .loader {
            border: 6px solid #E2E8F0; border-top: 6px solid #F59E0B;
            border-radius: 50%; width: 80px; height: 80px;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

        #toast {
            visibility: hidden; min-width: 300px; background-color: #333; color: #fff;
            text-align: center; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; position: fixed;
            z-index: 50; left: 50%; bottom: 40px; transform: translateX(-50%);
            opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s, bottom 0.3s; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700;
        }
        #toast.show { visibility: visible; opacity: 1; bottom: 120px; } 
        
        .full-screen-result { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; width: 100%; text-align: center; height: 100%; min-height: 50vh; padding-top: 1rem;}

        /* ======== 인쇄 설정 ======== */
        @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 0; } 
        
        @media print {
            * {
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important; 
                print-color-adjust: exact !important;
                color-adjust: exact !important;
            }
            body, html { width: 100%; height: 100vh; background-color: white !important; font-size: 11px !important; padding: 0 !important; margin: 0 !important; color: #111827 !important; display: block !important; overflow: hidden !important; }
            
            .kiosk-container { width: 100% !important; max-width: 100% !important; height: 100vh !important; max-height: 100vh !important; padding: 6mm 12mm !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; box-shadow: none !important; border: none !important; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; overflow: hidden !important; border-radius: 0 !important;}
            
            header, #nav-container, .no-print, #progress-container { display: none !important; }
            
            .step-container { display: none !important; padding: 0 !important; }
            #step-10 { display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; opacity: 1 !important; padding: 0 !important; height: 100%; }
            #result-state { height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding-bottom: 0 !important; }
            
            .px-8 { padding-left: 0 !important; padding-right: 0 !important; }
            
            .print-header { margin-bottom: 8px !important; text-align: center !important; position: relative !important; width: 100% !important;}
            .print-logo { display: block !important; position: absolute !important; left: 0 !important; top: 0 !important; height: 18px !important; object-fit: contain !important;}
            
            .print-header h2 { font-size: 22px !important; margin-bottom: 0px !important; font-weight: 900 !important; color: #4C1D95 !important;}
            .print-header span { font-size: 11px !important; font-weight: 600 !important; color: #4B5563 !important;}
            .print-header .bg-purple-100 { padding: 2px 6px !important; font-size: 9px !important; margin-bottom: 2px !important; }
            
            .print-grid-container { display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; gap: 6px !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; flex-grow: 1 !important; overflow: hidden !important; }
            
            .print-card { border-radius: 6px !important; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0 !important; padding: 0 !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; background-color: white !important;}
            .print-card-header { padding: 4px 10px !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0 !important;}
            .print-card-header h3 { font-size: 12px !important; font-weight: 900 !important; margin: 0 !important;}
            .print-card-body { padding: 6px 10px !important; }
            
            .print-image-card { flex-grow: 1 !important; display: flex !important; flex-direction: column !important; min-height: 0 !important; overflow: hidden !important; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0 !important; border-radius: 6px !important;}
            .print-image-card .print-card-body { padding: 0 !important; flex-grow: 1 !important; display: flex !important; justify-content: center !important; align-items: center !important;}
            #res-image { width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; max-height: 100% !important; object-fit: contain !important; border-bottom-left-radius: 6px; border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;}
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <main class="kiosk-container relative">
        
        <!-- 상단 헤더 영역 -->
        <header class="bg-hero-purple p-6 text-center relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 sm:rounded-t-2xl">
            <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-32 h-32 bg-white rounded-full opacity-10"></div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 w-24 h-24 bg-white rounded-full opacity-10"></div>
            <img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=12SbsYVibJUeT5MG-6LffGEJyBoVjX3tG&sz=w400" alt="회사 로고" class="absolute top-6 left-6 h-8 object-contain bg-white rounded-lg px-2 py-1 shadow-md z-20">
            <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-1">
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">창업가정신 히어로</h1>
            </div>
            <p class="text-purple-200 mt-2 relative z-10 text-base font-semibold">일상의 불편함을 발견하고 세상을 바꾸는 아이디어를 제안하세요!</p>
        </header>

        <!-- 진행률 표시 바 -->
        <div id="progress-container" class="w-full bg-gray-200 h-2 hidden relative">
            <div id="progress-bar" class="bg-hero-yellow h-2 transition-all duration-300 w-0"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 영역 -->
        <div class="px-8 pt-6 flex-grow flex flex-col overflow-y-auto w-full scroll-smooth">
            
            <div id="step-1" class="step-container active">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full min-h-[50vh] mt-auto mb-auto">
                    <div class="w-40 h-40 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-10 animate-bounce-slight text-hero-purple text-7xl shadow-inner">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-mask"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-800 mb-6 text-center tracking-tight leading-snug">히어로님,<br>환영합니다!</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-10 text-center font-bold text-xl">세상을 바꿀 당신의 멋진 히어로명을 알려주세요.</p>
                    <div class="w-full max-w-md mt-4">
                        <input type="text" id="hero-name-input" placeholder="이름을 입력하세요" class="w-full p-6 border-4 border-gray-300 rounded-2xl focus:border-hero-lightPurple focus:ring-4 focus:ring-purple-100 outline-none transition-all text-center text-3xl font-black text-gray-800 shadow-sm" autocomplete="off">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 예시 화면 -->
            <div id="step-2" class="step-container">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-4 w-full">
                    <div class="inline-block bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-black text-base mb-4 border border-yellow-200 shadow-sm">MISSION START</div>
                    <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-hero-purple mb-5 break-keep leading-tight text-center">창업가정신(Entrepreneurship)이란?</h2>
                    
                    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50 p-6 rounded-3xl border-4 border-hero-lightPurple shadow-lg w-full mb-8 relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-24 h-24 bg-yellow-200 rounded-full opacity-50"></div>
                        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 w-20 h-20 bg-purple-200 rounded-full opacity-50"></div>
                        <p class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-800 leading-relaxed break-keep relative z-10 text-center">
                            스스로 생각하고 행동하여 <br>
                            <span class="text-hero-purple underline decoration-wavy decoration-hero-yellow text-4xl bg-yellow-100 px-3 py-1.5 rounded mt-3 inline-block">세상에 이로운 변화</span>를<br> 만들어 내는 정신
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="w-full">
                        <p class="text-xl font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">💡 일상 속 불편함과 아이디어 예시</p>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 text-left">
                            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-row items-center p-5 sm:p-6 gap-6">
                                <div class="w-[45%] relative flex-shrink-0 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2">
                                    <img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1M14mlfAAgSZy4klwxG4gwk4q7JDaGpJK&sz=w1000" alt="탁구대 문" class="w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-xl shadow-sm">
                                </div>
                                <div class="w-[55%] flex flex-col justify-center py-2 pr-2">
                                    <span class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-hero-lightPurple bg-purple-100 px-5 py-2 rounded-full w-max mb-3 sm:mb-4">예시 1</span>
                                    <p class="text-2xl sm:text-[1.75rem] font-black text-gray-800 leading-snug mb-2 sm:mb-3 break-keep tracking-tight">불편: 탁구대 놓을 자리가 없어</p>
                                    <p class="text-2xl sm:text-[1.75rem] text-hero-darkYellow font-black leading-snug break-keep tracking-tight">아이디어: 탁구대로 변신하는 문</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-row items-center p-5 sm:p-6 gap-6">
                                <div class="w-[45%] relative flex-shrink-0 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2">
                                    <img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1UGKxj4nT40s6vQqydW1G74ZVr7SgdPW3&sz=w1000" alt="계산기 카트" class="w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-xl shadow-sm">
                                </div>
                                <div class="w-[55%] flex flex-col justify-center py-2 pr-2">
                                    <span class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-hero-lightPurple bg-purple-100 px-5 py-2 rounded-full w-max mb-3 sm:mb-4">예시 2</span>
                                    <p class="text-2xl sm:text-[1.75rem] font-black text-gray-800 leading-snug mb-2 sm:mb-3 break-keep tracking-tight">불편: 장을 보다 예산을 초과해</p>
                                    <p class="text-2xl sm:text-[1.75rem] text-hero-darkYellow font-black leading-snug break-keep tracking-tight">아이디어: 계산기 부착 쇼핑카트</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 성향 테스트 1~3 -->
            <div id="step-3" class="step-container">
                <div class="w-full mt-auto mb-auto">
                    <div class="text-center mb-10">
                        <span class="text-lg font-black text-gray-400 tracking-wider">히어로 성향 테스트 [1/3]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-hero-purple mt-4 tracking-tight break-keep leading-tight">Q1. 학교 축제(학예회) 준비 중, 나의 첫 행동은?</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5">
                        <div class="test-option test-option-A rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t1" data-val="A">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionA text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">A</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionA mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i> 정보 검색</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"다른 반이나 다른 학교는 어떻게 했지?" 인터넷으로 인기 있는 아이디어를 찾아본다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="test-option test-option-B rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t1" data-val="B">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionB text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">B</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionB mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-excel"></i> 꼼꼼한 계획</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"준비물은 뭐고, 자리는 어떻게 정하지?" 필요한 돈과 순서부터 꼼꼼하게 정리한다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="test-option test-option-C rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t1" data-val="C">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionC text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">C</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionC mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i> 바로 실행</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"생각난 김에 빨리하자!" 일단 도화지를 펴서 무작정 포스터부터 뚝딱뚝딱 그리기 시작한다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="test-option test-option-D rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t1" data-val="D">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionD text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">D</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionD mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i> 친구 챙기기</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"너는 이거 하고, 나는 이거 할게!" 다투지 않게 역할을 나누고, 속상해하는 친구를 먼저 달래준다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="step-4" class="step-container">
                <div class="w-full mt-auto mb-auto">
                    <div class="text-center mb-10">
                        <span class="text-lg font-black text-gray-400 tracking-wider">히어로 성향 테스트 [2/3]</span>
                        <h2 class="text-4xl font-black text-hero-purple mt-4 tracking-tight break-keep leading-tight">Q2. 모둠 숙제 발표 전날, 완전히 잘못한 걸 깨달았다! 나의 선택은?</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5">
                        <div class="test-option test-option-A rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t2" data-val="A">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionA text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">A</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionA mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-crosshairs"></i> 중요한 것 찾기</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">당황하지 않고, 선생님이 가장 중요하게 보실 부분이 어디인지 빠르게 다시 찾아본다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="test-option test-option-B rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t2" data-val="B">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionB text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">B</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionB mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul"></i> 처음부터 확인</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"어디서부터 잘못된 거지?" 처음 계획했던 내용부터 차근차근 다시 살펴보고 원인을 찾는다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="test-option test-option-C rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t2" data-val="C">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionC text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">C</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionC mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-keyboard"></i> 일단 다시 하기</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"밤을 새워서라도 다 하면 되지!" 일단 연필부터 잡고 당장 다시 숙제를 하기 시작한다.</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="test-option test-option-D rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex items-center gap-5 sm:gap-6 cursor-pointer shadow-md border-2 border-transparent hover:border-hero-lightPurple" data-q="t2" data-val="D">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-hero-optionD text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-3xl flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">D</div>
                            <div class="w-full">
                                <div class="text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl font-black text-hero-optionD mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 tracking-tight"><i class="fa-solid fa-mug-hot"></i> 친구들 응원하기</div>
                                <div class="text-base font-bold text-gray-500 leading-snug break-keep">"괜찮아, 할 수 있어!" 깜짝 놀란 모둠 친구들에게 간식을 주면서 기운을 북돋아 준다.</div>
                            </div>
